<view class="page">
  <view class="top-bar" style="{{topBarStyle}}">
    <button class="avatar-button" bindtap="goToProfile">
      <view class="avatar-circle">旅</view>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="hero">
    <view class="section-label">THIS PLACE HAS LEGENDS</view>
    <view class="hero-title">此地有传说</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">一个会讲故事的AI地图</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">
      每一个地点都可能藏着另一种讲法。你只需要从这里出发，去听听世界怎么开口。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="primary-entry panel">
    <view class="entry-icon">🔍</view>
    <view class="panel-title">寻找传说</view>
    <view class="panel-text">
      从不同视角进入地点故事，先看看民间传说和 AI 观察会怎样描述这里。
    </view>
    <view class="actions">
      <button class="action-button" bindtap="goToExplore">寻找传说</button>
      <button class="action-button secondary" bindtap="goToPublish">分享传说</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
